  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "If NECRONS is your Army Faction, as your Command phase ends, every unit of yours on the battlefield that has this ability triggers its Reanimation Protocols and heals D3 wounds. Each healed wound goes to a model in the unit that has lost wounds, giving it back one; only when no model in the unit is wounded does a healed wound instead revive one destroyed model of the unit (never a CHARACTER model) with 1 wound left. No model can go above the wounds it began the battle with, and wounds that cannot be used are lost.",
